  "story": {
    "day": 153,
    "title": "Kaya's Busy Holiday Trip",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya's holiday started early. It was sunny and warm.",
      "She thought about her school trip to the amusement park.",
      "Her mom cut an onion. She added a tablespoon of sake to boil soup.",
      "This research was needed. The plane left at 2 p.m.",
      "They were excited. Kaya felt scared to climb a forty-meter ride.",
      "Her hand held her dad’s. Her finger pointed. A blackout made her scream!",
      "It was quite cool. Later, she was tired. Her leg and knee hurt.",
      "She needed the restroom. Her neck felt stiff. She was sleepy.",
      "They saw a great drama once. It was an important lesson.",
      "They took a million photographs. She wanted to catch a bus home.",
      "Why was it all so free? Because it was fun. Her foot was tired.",
      "She missed the swimming pool, playground, and gym today."
    ]
  }
}